{{!
    @template local_edguidance/block

    One teacher guidance block, wherever it is shown: an activity card, a book chapter, a lesson page
    or a section summary.

    Both states are rendered - the guidance, and the help icon it collapses to once dismissed - and
    the server decides which one starts hidden. local_edguidance/guidance only toggles between them.

    This must never contain the data-edguidance attribute. That is the token filter_edguidance looks
    for, and mod_lesson runs some text through the filters twice.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id int - local_edguidance.id
    * body string - already formatted HTML, rendered unescaped
    * missing bool - the preset it used has gone, so the body is a possibly stale copy
    * dismissed bool - the current user has dismissed it
    * section bool - it is in a section summary rather than in an activity
    * preview bool - for the editor's preview: no buttons, because a click anywhere on it edits it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 42,
        "body": "<p>Set the due date before releasing this to students.</p>",
        "missing": false,
        "dismissed": false,
        "section": false,
        "preview": false
    }
}}
<div class="edguidance{{#dismissed}} edguidance-is-dismissed{{/dismissed}}" data-region="edguidance" data-guidanceid="{{id}}">
    <div class="edguidance-card" data-region="edguidance-full"{{#dismissed}} hidden{{/dismissed}}>
        <div class="edguidance-header">
            <span class="edguidance-title">{{#str}} guidance, local_edguidance {{/str}}</span>
            <span class="edguidance-scope">{{#str}} onlyteachers, local_edguidance {{/str}}</span>
            {{^preview}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm edguidance-dismiss" data-action="edguidance-dismiss"
                aria-label="{{#str}} dismissguidance, local_edguidance {{/str}}">{{#str}} dismiss, local_edguidance {{/str}}</button>
            {{/preview}}
        </div>
        {{#missing}}
            <div class="alert alert-info edguidance-missing" role="alert">{{#str}} guidancemissing, local_edguidance {{/str}}</div>
        {{/missing}}
        <div class="edguidance-body">{{{body}}}</div>
    </div>
    {{^preview}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 icon-no-margin edguidance-restore" data-region="edguidance-collapsed"
        data-action="edguidance-restore"
        aria-label="{{#section}}{{#str}} reviewsection, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/section}}{{^section}}{{#str}} review, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/section}}"{{^dismissed}} hidden{{/dismissed}}>
        {{#pix}} help, core {{/pix}}
    </button>
    {{/preview}}
</div>
